# Agent workflow

- Do **not** run `npm run build` after every task. Only when the user asks, when fixing CI/build errors, or after risky changes (config, types, middleware, auth).
- Do **not** `git push`, create commits, or open PRs unless the user explicitly requests it.
- For routine edits, use targeted lint/type feedback on changed files instead of a full production build.
